- the soliton candidate retired as program-native (route c), with the PeV-scale model noted as prior art;
- superheavy-plus-dilution rejected.
#14 moved to notes/ as withdrawn ('Withdrawn (2026-10-19) after failing round-3 review (verdict C)'). verify/knot_numbers.py was replaced by verify/soliton_obituary.py, which checks the corrected record against independent anchors.

